'''Vengeance Sphere''' is a positive [[status effect]] that surrounds the affected entity in a blue spherical barrier. 

When a unit with '''Vengeance Sphere''' receive damage, it automatically launches back a projectile toward the attacker dealing a fixed amount of [[Frost]] damage.

Vengeance Sphere is obtained by using the [[Northern Vengeance]] on the player and all allies in a 5-meters radius. The spell lasts 60 seconds per levels.

